{"product_id":"rebels-city-of-indra","title":"Rebels, city of Indra","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"Kendall and Kylie Jenner, stars on the hit reality show Keeping Up with the Kardashians, present their debut novel--a thrilling dystopian story about two super-powered girls who embark on a journey together.  Two cities... Two girls... A shared destiny...  In a world of the far future, the great city of Indra has two faces: a beautiful paradise floating high in the sky, and a nightmare world of poverty carved into tunnels beneath the surface of the earth. Kendall and Kylie Jenner, the youngest sisters in the Kardashian dynasty, have written a gripping tale of air, fire, and a bond of blood\"-- \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:28 x 220  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Jenner Kendall Nicole \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781451694420 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Hardcover \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43603259654297,"sku":"15RA-2-9781451694420","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/Rebels_cityofIndra.jpg?v=1702885677","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/rebels-city-of-indra","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}